{"unit_id":"JuneLearn__dsh-image2-draw#feature-1","repo":"JuneLearn/dsh-image2-draw","commit":"78972d05d604a73fed32323cd3ec3e5506e2fdfe","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Image2 Draw 的功能「文字生成图片」：调用 image2-generate 并提交提示词，可选择尺寸和质量；支持顺序生成 1 到 8 张，图片会保存并显示在会话中。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:823-850","lib/index.js:461-478"]}
